<title>CHINA: Shanghai Automation net down 18.95 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Automation net down 18.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	    1,205.12	vs	 1,084.84</p>
<p> Net profit	     48.23	vs	    59.51</p>
<p> Net asset per share    2.06   yuan    vs   2.04   yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.1462 yuan    vs   0.2074 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Automation Instrument Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: The results were published in a statement on Friday. The figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a one-for-10 bonus issue, pending approval at a shareholders meeting.</p>
</text>
